w an employee flouted company rules and needs to be disciplined.</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></response_label></flow_label><flow_label class="Block"><response_label ident="3837D95C1E7142288EE228C6DCF5EFA1" shuffle="Yes" rarea="Ellipse" rrange="Exact"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">The sales manager needs to send to the COO confidential information relating to a tender that the company is submitting.</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></response_label></flow_label><flow_label class="Block"><response_label ident="618D5BDFAC4C4166827C89FD6BDA7D2E" shuffle="Yes" rarea="Ellipse" rrange="Exact"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">The marketing manager needs to present next year&amp;#x27;s marketing budget and plan to the Board of Directors.</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></response_label></flow_label><flow_label class="Block"><response_label ident="9E2557E03E6F4B19A6813B9EEC80E80A" shuffle="Yes" rarea="Ellipse" rrange="Exact"><flow_mat class="FORMATTED_TEXT_BLOCK"><material><mat_extension><mat_formattedtext type="HTML">The operations manager needs to direct the work of the support staff working on repairing a key piece of machinery and get real-time updates from them.</mat_formattedtext></mat_extension></material></flow_mat></response_label></flow_label></render_choice></response_lid></flow></flow></presentation><resprocessing scoremodel="SumOfScores"><outcomes><decvar varname="SCORE" vartype="Decimal" defaultval="0.0" minvalue="0.0" maxvalue="1.00"/></outcomes><respcondition title="correct"><conditionvar><varequal respident="response" case="No">9E2557E03E6F4B19A6813B9EEC80E80A</varequal></conditionvar><setvar variablename="SCORE" action="Set">SCORE.max</setvar><displayfeedback linkrefid="correct" feedbacktype="Response"/></respcondition><respcondition title="incorrect"><cond